<title>LUXEMBOURG: TENNIS-LUXEMBOURG WOMEN'S CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LUXEMBOURG WOMEN'S CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results from the $165,000 Luxembourg women's tennis championship: Anke Huber (Germany) beat Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) 6-4 7-6 Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat Barbara Paulus (Austria) 5-7 7-5 6-3</p>
</text>
